      "duration_ms": 365000,
      "summary": [
        "Replaced the Model Registry tab stub with a full implementation in mcp-server/gui/public/views/config.js. The tab maintains module-level state (mrModels / mrOriginal / mrEditingId) initialized from server data on first render. Features implemented: model table with name/slug/cc_model columns; inline row editing with Edit/Done/Cancel buttons; dirty indicator dots on changed fields (compared against the original server snapshot); strikethrough + Restore button for pending deletions (no immediate DOM removal); client-side slug validation against /^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$/ with reserved 'inherit' check and inline error messages; Save button disabled while validation errors exist; Add Model form with auto-slug derivation from name (tracks whether slug has been manually overridden), editable slug field, cc_model field with helper text, and crypto.randomUUID() for new model IDs; Save (PUT /api/models) with 409 conflict handling directing users to Replace Model on Persona Models tab; Load Defaults (POST /api/models/load-defaults) with confirmation dialog and slug-collision conflict display. Added corresponding CSS classes (.mr-dirty-dot, .mr-model-deleted, .mr-model-new, .mr-edit-row, .mr-field-error, .mr-error-text, .mr-add-section, .mr-action-bar) to styles.css. All 3523 existing tests pass; Node --check confirms no syntax errors."
      ],
